# Press kit video. The stills and plates are committed; the trailer is not.
#
# Not because of its size today but because of its size repeated: video delta-compresses no better
# than the PNGs "The one long-term cost" in docs/ROADMAP.md is about, and unlike the sprites it is
# not a build input, cannot be checked by CI, and is re-cut whenever the marketing changes. Every
# re-cut would append another full copy to a history that is already 280 MB. It ships as a Release
# asset instead -- see docs/press/README.md.
docs/press/trailer/*.mp4

# The per-clip captures the trailer is joined from. Gigabytes, and trailer.sh rebuilds them.
docs/press/trailer/clips/
